243 0 obj
<<
  /Type /StructElem
  /S /H2
  /P 242 0 R
  /T (You will create a simple time tracking application where users can log their daily work hours with a description of the tasks performed. To ensure simplicity, the application will not have authentication or user management: all entries are public and can be created, edited, viewed or deleted by anyone connected. All entries can be linked to a predefined list of projects and tagged with multiple predefined labels. The app should propose a clean system to clock in and out (and change clocked projects or labels). A table with pagination should list all entries. CRUD operations should be available to manage projects and labels. A statistics page should summarise total hours worked per project and per label (with time filters). The use of materialised views or similar techniques to optimise performance is encouraged.)
  /K [26 244 0 R]
  /Pg 651 0 R
>>
endobj

