  /Type /StructElem
  /S /H2
  /P 245 0 R
  /T (The goal is to deliver a small but complete product: a web UI, a real API, and a database, all working together with strong typing, good error handling and separation of concerns.)
  /K [23 247 0 R]
  /Pg 651 0 R
>>
